Package: traverse
Title: Spatial Passage Across Gridded Landscapes
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person(given = "John", family = "Humphreys", email = "JMHumphreys@users.noreply.github.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Estimates randomized passage and connectivity across gridded
    landscapes. The package distinguishes a target study domain from a larger
    buffered computational domain, supports external source and target
    terminals, and returns passage intensity summarizing many possible routes.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/geoepi/traverse
